<Slide notes={`我把四个候选逐条读一遍。
A 是十八点到十九点，正常交谈，满足场地规则。B 是十九点到二十点，正常交谈，也满足。C 是十九点五十到二十点五十，它正好在二十点五十结束，仍然满足场地规则，只是后面要留出收整时间。D 是十九点到二十点，模式换成静默共读，同样满足。
四条候选在共同规则这一层全部通过。判断标准必须说清楚：三个人对同一个候选都明确同意，才记一致意见。
保留、反对、未回应都要如实记录下来，主持人也不能事后临时把它改成多数通过——那样做等于替别人表态。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>4.6.1　共同事实与四个候选</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>四个候选，逐条核对</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20 }}>

        <Box style={{ height: 382, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, justifyContent: 'center' }}>

            <Box style={{ height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4 }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 90 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#546779' }}>候选</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 260 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#546779' }}>时间</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 240 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#546779' }}>模式</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#546779' }}>场地规则</Text></Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 78, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 90 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>A</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 260 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#20344B' }}>18:00 — 19:00</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 240 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>正常交谈</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>满足</Text></Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 78, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 90 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>B</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 260 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#20344B' }}>19:00 — 20:00</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 240 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>正常交谈</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>满足</Text></Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 78, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#276FBF' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 90 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>C</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 260 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#20344B' }}>19:50 — 20:50</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 240 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>正常交谈</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>满足，余 10 分钟收整</Text></Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 78, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 14px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#26816B' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 90 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>D</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 260 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#20344B' }}>19:00 — 20:00</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 240 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>静默共读</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>满足</Text></Box>
